WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.501 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Hi! How are you?
-Hi. I'm fine.

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:03.436 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Welcome back.
-Thank you.

00:00:03.436 --> 00:00:04.504 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Just fine?
-What's that?

00:00:04.504 --> 00:00:06.773
-Just fine?
-Well, because I'm sick and ti--

00:00:06.773 --> 00:00:08.341 align:start size:94% position:6%
I wish I could be
behind the desk.

00:00:08.341 --> 00:00:10.310 align:start size:94% position:6%
Now, ever since
the days of social media,

00:00:10.310 --> 00:00:12.712 align:start size:94% position:6%
now you go on a show,
I'm supposed to be funny.

00:00:12.712 --> 00:00:13.446 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's all.
-Uh-huh.

00:00:13.446 --> 00:00:17.817
-But now I have people who think
they're Tim Gunn, you know,

00:00:17.817 --> 00:00:19.019 size:78% position:39% line:92%
my Twitter followers.

00:00:19.019 --> 00:00:21.488 size:78% position:39%
They're wearing Jorts
and, like, cut-off,

00:00:21.488 --> 00:00:23.056
you know, Ultimate Fighter
shirts, and they're like,

00:00:23.056 --> 00:00:27.160
"Those are the same sneakers
you wore three months ago."

00:00:27.160 --> 00:00:29.963 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's like, "Shut up."
[ Laughter ]

00:00:29.963 --> 00:00:31.031 line:92%
In the old days, you'd just --

00:00:31.031 --> 00:00:32.098 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Do you feel
self-conscious about it?

00:00:32.098 --> 00:00:34.567 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It just irritates me
that everybody can judge

00:00:34.567 --> 00:00:37.203 align:start size:94% position:6%
your wardrobe that's not even
in the fashion industry.

00:00:37.203 --> 00:00:38.104 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.
-It's bad enough

00:00:38.104 --> 00:00:39.272 align:start size:94% position:6%
we live in a world
where Fashion Week

00:00:39.272 --> 00:00:42.609 align:start size:94% position:6%
is every month in New York,
but now you have idiots

00:00:42.609 --> 00:00:44.778
all over the place going,
"Yeah, I saw the jacket."

00:00:44.778 --> 00:00:46.813 align:start size:94% position:6%
Shut up. You don't know
what you're talking about.

00:00:46.813 --> 00:00:50.383
-Not only do you look
presentable, you look very fit.

00:00:50.383 --> 00:00:52.485 align:start size:94% position:6%
You look very healthy.
And these are all good things,

00:00:52.485 --> 00:00:54.387 align:start size:94% position:6%
because since
the last time I saw you,

00:00:54.387 --> 00:00:56.356 size:84% position:42%
you had a heart attack.
-I had a heart attack.

00:00:56.356 --> 00:00:58.992 align:start size:94% position:6%
And, you know --
No, here's what bothers me.

00:00:58.992 --> 00:01:02.395 align:start size:94% position:6%
'Cause I've been
in the business 105 years.

00:01:02.395 --> 00:01:02.929 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:02.929 --> 00:01:06.299
And I still have to tell people
I had a heart attack.

00:01:06.299 --> 00:01:08.668 align:start size:94% position:6%
Just now,
the guy from TMZ downstairs.

00:01:08.668 --> 00:01:09.636 line:92%
I swear to God, walking in,

00:01:09.636 --> 00:01:10.703 align:start size:94% position:6%
I go,
"Well, I had a heart attack."

00:01:10.703 --> 00:01:14.074 align:start size:94% position:6%
"You had a heart attack?"
Even TMZ, I have to tell them.

00:01:14.074 --> 00:01:15.809 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:15.809 --> 00:01:19.512
That's not fame the way
I always thought it would look.

00:01:19.512 --> 00:01:20.680 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.680 --> 00:01:21.748 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Sorry.

00:01:21.748 --> 00:01:23.583 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'll tell you
a true but sad story.

00:01:23.583 --> 00:01:25.752 align:start size:94% position:6%
These guys were bringing
a couch up a stoop

00:01:25.752 --> 00:01:28.188 align:start size:94% position:6%
down by where I was,
and this guy recognized me.

00:01:28.188 --> 00:01:29.923
Knew my name, 'cause I'm famous.
-Yeah.

00:01:29.923 --> 00:01:30.824 line:92%
-And he goes, "Colin Quinn,

00:01:30.824 --> 00:01:32.592 align:start size:94% position:6%
grab the other end
for a second?"

00:01:32.592 --> 00:01:33.193 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
He was serious.

00:01:33.193 --> 00:01:35.528
He wanted me to help him
bring a couch up the steps.

00:01:35.528 --> 00:01:39.265 align:start size:94% position:6%
You know, it's like, "Rihanna,
you got jumper cables?"

00:01:39.265 --> 00:01:40.600 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:44.904 align:start size:94% position:6%
But, yeah, I had heart attack,
and -- you know, people --

00:01:44.904 --> 00:01:48.641
I look at it, it's not the end.
It's the beginning of the end.

00:01:48.641 --> 00:01:53.546 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:53.546 --> 00:01:55.548 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Because now
I know I'm gonna die.

00:01:55.548 --> 00:01:57.717 align:start size:94% position:6%
Like, before this,
I figured I'd probably die.

00:01:57.717 --> 00:01:58.985 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Uh-huh.
-You know, you figure,

00:01:58.985 --> 00:01:59.886 line:92%
but now I'm like, "Oh, no.

00:01:59.886 --> 00:02:02.589 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm really gonna be
one of those that dies."

00:02:02.589 --> 00:02:03.156 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:03.156 --> 00:02:07.193
And the thing that bothers me
the most is -- two things.

00:02:07.193 --> 00:02:08.828 line:92%
One is, all my comedian friends,

00:02:08.828 --> 00:02:11.364
you'd expect them to be original
and have, like, a take.

00:02:11.364 --> 00:02:14.234 align:start size:94% position:6%
The same, tired clichés
that you people would say --

00:02:14.234 --> 00:02:16.369 align:start size:94% position:6%
no offense.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:16.369 --> 00:02:18.338 line:92%
Crowd's like, "Heh. Hey."

00:02:18.338 --> 00:02:20.039 align:start size:94% position:6%
Yeah, they're like,
"You were really lucky."

00:02:20.039 --> 00:02:21.608 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm like, "Yeah,
that was my lucky day.

00:02:21.608 --> 00:02:23.610 align:start size:94% position:6%
I should've played
Powerball that day."

00:02:23.610 --> 00:02:24.344 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:24.344 --> 00:02:26.146 align:start size:94% position:6%
That'll go down in history
as my lucky day

00:02:26.146 --> 00:02:27.680 align:start size:94% position:6%
that I'll always think about.
And, um...

00:02:27.680 --> 00:02:31.351
No, but it's like, I know how
people look at heart attacks.

00:02:31.351 --> 00:02:33.286 size:84% position:42%
Like, I always looked
at heart-attack people,

00:02:33.286 --> 00:02:35.054 align:start size:94% position:6%
and I know people
look at me that way now,

00:02:35.054 --> 00:02:36.856 align:start size:94% position:6%
which is, like,
"You're not dead,

00:02:36.856 --> 00:02:40.326
but you're not a reliable
member of the planet."

00:02:40.326 --> 00:02:40.894 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:40.894 --> 00:02:44.531
"You're not somebody that we're
gonna count on in the long run.

00:02:44.531 --> 00:02:47.934
You know, give plans like
a month ahead, nut, you know...

00:02:47.934 --> 00:02:49.302 align:start size:94% position:6%
'Cause it's, like,
you're on, like,

00:02:49.302 --> 00:02:52.272 align:start size:94% position:6%
some kind of a warning track
or an on-deck circle.

00:02:52.272 --> 00:02:54.274
You're not dead, 'cause
the most important thing in life

00:02:54.274 --> 00:02:57.911
is survival, and you're not
great at that, basically.

00:02:57.911 --> 00:02:58.778 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:58.778 --> 00:03:00.480 align:start size:94% position:6%
'Cause if I went out --
Like, if right now,

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:02.448 align:start size:94% position:6%
anybody in this audience
goes outside and dies

00:03:02.448 --> 00:03:05.518 align:start size:94% position:6%
in the street, on 49th street,
it'll be a tragedy.

00:03:05.518 --> 00:03:07.720 align:start size:94% position:6%
If I die, people will be like,
"That was sad.

00:03:07.720 --> 00:03:09.856 align:start size:94% position:6%
He didn't have the heart,
though, You know?"

00:03:09.856 --> 00:03:11.591 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

